  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Strategic Partnership VNG International Benin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Flooding, although affecting the population, is crucial for fishing and agriculture. An integrated IWRM approach is needed to balance local risks and benefits. Despite the establishment of national organs, their local application remains limited. SDLG Benin will work with local authorities to better operationalise local IWRM and involve citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description akvo:type="4" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Supporting local governments to execute policies to manage community resilience in a safe and socially equal way for all on lands with climate and water-related risks in 5 municipalities of the BVO.</narrative>
  </description>
